body:

For general inquiries: [gewenxin.yu@proton.me](mailto:gewenxin.yu@proton.me)

## Collaboration inquiries

We welcome collaborations with institutions, researchers, and practitioners in sound, acoustics, mountaineering, and related fields. For partnership or research inquiries, write to the same address above.

## Social Media

Stay connected with <logo>Mantle</logo> Sound through our social media:

- <img src="/static/mastodon.svg" alt="Mastodon" class="social-media-icon"> [Mastodon](https://mastodon.social/@mantle_sound) — updates on field recording and mountaineering acoustics research.
